<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421410/extras/efd8898594395ff569180b96cd98f5a8.avif?t=1749434064\" width=358 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatsune, a cute goddess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is very interested in human food.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff0aGame Features\uff0a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple classic RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy gameplay without fighting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the story of evil spirits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes some voice acting and sound effects</p>",
